# Per-deployer Cloudflare config — copy from wrangler.toml.example and fill in
# your own account's ids. Kept out of git for the same reason .dev.vars is:
# every self-deployer edits it, so tracking it means a permanently dirty tree
# and a conflict on every upstream pull.
wrangler.toml

# Seeded design-canvas payload — ~3 MB of editor runtime regenerated by the
# design tooling from the .dc.html sources beside it. The sources are tracked;
# the build output is not.
design-canvas/bandplate-colour-and-type.html
